Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(pwa):=20status=20bar=20follows=20in-app=20t?=
 =?UTF-8?q?heme=20=E2=80=94=20light=20theme=5Fcolor=20in=20manifest,=20dyn?=
